.TH KINTSUGI-DAG 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-dag \- run a node plan
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi dag
run <plan.yaml> [\-\-json] [\-\-max\-revisions N]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a node plan with gates and revise cycles. DAG plans define a graph of
tasks with dependencies.
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-json\fR
Print the report as JSON
.IP \fB\-\-max\-revisions\fR
Blocking-gate revise cycles per node (default 1)
.SH EXAMPLES
Run a plan:
.PP
  $ kintsugi dag run plan.yaml
.PP
JSON output:
.PP
  $ kintsugi dag run plan.yaml --json
.PP
Allow more revisions:
.PP
  $ kintsugi dag run plan.yaml --max-revisions 3
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1),
.BR kintsugi-gate (1)
